0562                         ; This is the new load and save routines to be integrated into this monitor
0563                         ; this will need to relocated to fit in the original Load and Punch routines
0564                         ;=============================================================================
0565                         
0566                         ; Spare bytes for LOAD and PUNCH commands are as follows
0567                         ; Original LOAD command space = 36 Bytes
0568                         ; Original PUNCH command space = 47 Bytes
0569                         ; Addition space where old X and Z commands were 81 bytes
0570                         ; Additional space where the old ALTER command was = 26 Bytes
0571                         ; Removed old ZIN releases 26 bytes
0572                         ; Removed olu ZOUT releases 13 bytes
0573                         ; Total free bytes = 229 bytes
0574                         
